nator from the 23rd district from 1985 to 2001.","extract_html":"<p><b>Addison Graves \"Joe\" Wilson Sr.</b> is an American politician and attorney serving as the U.S. representative for South Carolina's 2nd congressional district since 2001. A member of the Republican Party, his district stretches from Columbia to the Georgia–South Carolina border. He served as the South Carolina state senator from the 23rd district from 1985 to 2001.</p>"}